  "keyFeatures": [
    "Full Khmer language typesetting via XeLaTeX and fontspec with HarfBuzz renderer",
    "Khmer numeral system throughout — pages, equations, figures, and section numbers",
    "Custom sakura-themed design system: pink/purple palette, floral dividers, rounded formula boxes",
    "Git LFS-managed image assets for a lightweight cloneable repository",
    "latexmk-based build system with auto-reruns (no manual double-compile needed)",
    "Conventional Commits enforced via .githooks/commit-msg hook",
    "circuitikz integration for vector RL and LC circuit diagrams",
    "QR-code-linked YouTube video boxes (\\khmervideobox) for supplementary content",
    "83-page compiled handbook covering kinetic theory, waves, and electromagnetism",
    "Covers Grade 12 syllabus: Chapter 1 (kinetic theory), Chapter 2 (waves & interference), Chapter 3 (magnetism, induction, self-inductance, RL/LC circuits, alternating current)"
  ],
